	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Nihil habeo, quod scribam, nisi quod <persName>Zoilus</persName> ille meus tam <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>acerbus et superbus <persName>Valentinus</persName>, antichristianę relligionis <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>confidentissimus preco, 13. calendas maias interiit.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Plutoni <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>opinor etiam non iam suo in terris regi de <placeName ref="l257">Constantiensium</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>duritia conquesturus, quia pergant adversi esse quidam, proh <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>nimium pauci, suis delyramentis et floccifacere comminationes <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>suas.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Qui se redierit, quantas credis adferet bullas regalium <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>imperiorum?</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Vehementer admiror in tanta constantium <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>ovium paucitate tantam audiri de hac morte congratulationem.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z10"/>Ego, si non ad mortem peccavit, totis animis illi opto felicem <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>emigrationem, patrię vero meliorem antistitem.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z12"/>Fuit hodie mecum <placeName ref="l834">Italus</placeName> quidam <persName>Mirandulanus</persName>, qui aliquamdiu <lb xml:id="p1z13"/><placeName ref="l473">Sangalli</placeName> hęsit ex <placeName ref="l834">Italia</placeName> quibusdam illic commendatus tanquam <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>is, qui Christi caussa exulare cogatur.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Putarunt autem <placeName ref="l473">Sangallenses</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>mercatores istic felicius eum opificio suo in sericis pileis <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>et marsupiis conficiendis quam <placeName ref="l473">Sangalli</placeName> operam dare posse.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z17"/>Commendavit hunc mihi <persName ref="p8083">Fortmyllerus</persName> suis literis, quas hic <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>simul accipis; commendarunt etiam boni quidam alii viri, in<lb xml:id="p1z19"/>primis vero <persName>Iacobus hic Reutlingerus</persName>, qui has tibi exhibebit, <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>ut tibi bonum hunc iuvenem diligenter commendem, id quod <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>paucis hisce me fecisse existimes velim.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Mihi plane ignotus est, <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>sed illis penitius cognitus esse, qui tanta ipsum fide commendarunt; <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>videtur autem ipso corporis et vultus habito prę se ferre non vulgarem <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>honestatem.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Tu si quid potes, officiose illum iuva, quo habeat, unde <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>istic de manuum suarum labore vivat nec quemquam gravare cogatur.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z26"/>Novi quod scribam, nihil novi, nisi quod concilium <placeName ref="l55">Bononiam</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>a pontifice translatum quidam constanter affirmant.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Tu si <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>quid certi habes, fac, obsecro, paucis mihi significes.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z29"/><placeName ref="l303">Magdeburgenses</placeName> ita septos tantaque violentia obsessos, uti <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>intra paucos dies hosti se dedere cogantur, ex hostium castris <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>magno plausu scribitur.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Ego nihil huius credo, nisi digniores <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>fide testes audiero.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Dominus te, mi frater, ęternum conservet cum <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>tota tua domo, quacum Christo me meosque diligenter ac perpetuo <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>commenda.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l555">Vituduri</placeName>, 9. calendas maias 1551.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z35"/>T[uus] <persName ref="p8055">Ambr[osius] Blaurerus</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Praestantissimo viro d. <persName ref="p495">Heinricho <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>Bullingero</persName>, amico et <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>fratri suo incomparabili.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l587">Tiguri</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
